{"seq":3,"slug":"return-batch-consolidate","title":"退货批量集拼与回运","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/crossborder-returns-inspection-refurb-center/return-consolidate-overseas/return-batch-consolidate","wordCount":2163,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"退货批量集拼与回运\">退货批量集拼与回运</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>一件货被判定「值得回运」之后，它并不能立刻上路。以单件为单位的跨境运输在这个成本区间里是不存在的：承运商不愿意接一件没有托盘、没有统一申报口径、没有收货方清关资质的散货。所以回运候选池里的货必须经过一次<strong>批次化</strong>——攒够量、拼成单元、备齐单证、然后作为一个整体交给货代。这一篇讲的就是这个批次化过程：窗口怎么开、混拼怎么打、批次什么时候封。</p>\n<p>它的目标是让 <a href=\"../return-consolidate-overseas/dispose-local-vs-return\">1.2 就地处置 vs 回运决策</a> 里那个 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>r</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的估计值在现实中成立。决策时假设的批量费率，只有在批次真正达到最小经济规模时才兑现；一个迟迟攒不够量的批次，它的真实单件成本会持续高于决策时用的估计值。</p>\n<h2 id=\"拼批窗口-在时效与成本之间取平衡\">拼批窗口：在时效与成本之间取平衡</h2><p>拼批窗口是「攒多久」这个问题的答案，它是一个双约束问题：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>下界由成本决定</strong>：批次件数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mi>b</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N_b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 必须使单件固定成本分摊 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msub><mi>N</mi><mi>b</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F/N_b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 落入可接受区间。这给出一个最小批量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N_{min}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">min</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。</li>\n<li><strong>上界由时效与资金决定</strong>：退货在集货节点停留的每一天都在消耗 1.2 中的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span></span> 项，且占用节点仓位。这给出一个最长等待天数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{max}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ma</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>工程上这两个约束通常用一个「先到先出 + 阈值触发」的混合策略来近似：批次在 <code>BUILDING</code> 状态累积，满足 (<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mi>b</mi></msub><mo>≥</mo><msub><mi>N</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N_b \\ge N_{min}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">min</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>) 或 (age of oldest item <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≥</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\ge T_{max}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ma</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>) 任一条件即可封批。这里有一个容易忽略的细节——<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{max}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ma</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> <strong>应该按品类而不是全局设置</strong>，因为不同品类的折旧速率差得远。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>品类族</th>\n<th>典型折旧特征</th>\n<th><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{max}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ma</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 取向</th>\n<th>原因</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>消费电子</td>\n<td>迭代快，换代即贬值</td>\n<td>短（按周计）</td>\n<td>新品发布周期压缩残值窗口</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>服饰纺织</td>\n<td>强季节性与快时尚周期</td>\n<td>短且按季节切换</td>\n<td>过季即难以原渠道再售</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>家居家电</td>\n<td>曲线平缓</td>\n<td>长（按月计）</td>\n<td>贬值慢，等待成本低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>配件与耗材</td>\n<td>近似不折旧</td>\n<td>长</td>\n<td>与主机残值脱钩</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>季节性商品</td>\n<td>季节性断崖</td>\n<td>按季节点硬约束</td>\n<td>错过季节等于全损</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>同一个批次窗口套在所有品类上，必然有一类会被错误处理：用电子品的短窗口去套家电，会造成大量「还没攒够量就被迫封批」的低效批次；用家电的长窗口去套电子品，会让这批货在等待中贬值到低于回运成本。</p>\n<h3 id=\"按目的节点分流\">按目的节点分流</h3><p>批次化的第二个维度是<strong>目的节点</strong>。回运货的终点不止一个：可能是国内的翻新中心，也可能是保税区内的维修厂（见 <a href=\"../return-reimport-customs/bonded-repair-reprocess\">2.2 保税维修/再加工模式</a>）。这两个终点在单证、承运资质、甚至装卸要求上都不同，因此一个批次只能有一个目的节点，混目的地的货不能装进同一个集装单元。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[回运候选池] --&gt; B{按目的节点分组}&#10;  B --&gt; C[目的地=国内翻新中心]&#10;  B --&gt; D[目的地=保税维修区]&#10;  C --&gt; E{同品类组&lt;br/&gt;条件 A/B/C/D}&#10;  D --&gt; E&#10;  E --&gt; F[批次构建中&lt;br/&gt;BUILDING]&#10;  F --&gt; G{N_b &gt;= N_min&lt;br/&gt;或 最老件龄 &gt;= T_max?}&#10;  G --&gt;|否| F&#10;  G --&gt;|是| H[封批 SEALED&lt;br/&gt;生成集装单元清单]&#10;  H --&gt; I[单证准备&lt;br/&gt;见 2.3]&#10;  I --&gt; J{单证齐备?}&#10;  J --&gt;|否| K[补证队列&lt;br/&gt;批次挂起]&#10;  J --&gt;|是| L[交付出运 HANDED_OVER]\">graph TD\n  A[回运候选池] --&gt; B{按目的节点分组}\n  B --&gt; C[目的地=国内翻新中心]\n  B --&gt; D[目的地=保税维修区]\n  C --&gt; E{同品类组&lt;br/&gt;条件 A/B/C/D}\n  D --&gt; E\n  E --&gt; F[批次构建中&lt;br/&gt;BUILDING]\n  F --&gt; G{N_b &gt;= N_min&lt;br/&gt;或 最老件龄 &gt;= T_max?}\n  G --&gt;|否| F\n  G --&gt;|是| H[封批 SEALED&lt;br/&gt;生成集装单元清单]\n  H --&gt; I[单证准备&lt;br/&gt;见 2.3]\n  I --&gt; J{单证齐备?}\n  J --&gt;|否| K[补证队列&lt;br/&gt;批次挂起]\n  J --&gt;|是| L[交付出运 HANDED_OVER]</pre><p><code>K</code> 这条边在实践中非常常见，也是回运时效最大的不可控因素：<strong>批次在物理上已经封好，但清关单证还没齐</strong>。把「封批」与「单证齐备」分成两个独立状态，才能区分「物流慢」和「合规慢」两种不同的延迟，这是运营侧最需要的归因能力。</p>\n<h2 id=\"混拼的物理约束\">混拼的物理约束</h2><p>混拼不是把货丢进箱子那么简单。一个集装单元里同时装着不同 SKU、不同成色、甚至不同危险品等级的货，会立刻引入三类约束。</p>\n<h3 id=\"危险品兼容性\">危险品兼容性</h3><p>锂电池是跨境电商退货里最常见的危险品类别。国际航空运输对锂电池有明确的运输限制，IATA 的危险品规则把锂电池按瓦时额定值（可充电池）或锂含量（不可充电池）分类，并对备用电池与装在设备内/随设备包装的电池给出不同的包装指令（见 <a href=\"https://www.iata.org/en/programs/cargo/dgr/lithium-batteries/\">IATA Lithium Batteries guidance</a>）。这意味着<strong>带回运的电子类退货不能与其他货随意混装</strong>：一方面部分载具与包装指令禁止混装，另一方面批次的危险品申报会影响整批的可选运输方式与报价。工程上的做法是在批次构建时就带一个 <code>dangerous_goods_class</code> 字段，同批次内取最严格者作为整批的申报等级。</p>\n<h3 id=\"申报品名与编码一致性\">申报品名与编码一致性</h3><p>海关看的是申报，不是实物。一个混拼批次里如果有二十个不同 HS 编码的商品，申报复杂度会急剧上升，且一旦某项编码填错，整批都可能被查验。实务上常见的对策是<strong>按申报口径收敛批次组成</strong>：把 HS 编码（六位及以上）落在同一大类的货放进同一批，长尾编码的单件单独归入一个「杂项」子批。这个收敛不是为了让申报好看，而是因为它直接决定了查验概率与滞港风险，而滞港成本最终会回到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>r</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 里。</p>\n<h3 id=\"装载与体积重\">装载与体积重</h3><p>装载方案要在体积与重量双约束下做优化，因为跨境报价取体积重与实重中的较大者。设单元的实际重量为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span></span>、体积为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span></span></span></span></span>，体积重换算系数为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span>（常见取 5000–6000 cm³/kg，即 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 越大越宽松），计费重为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>W</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mi>W</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mfrac><mi>V</mi><mi>k</mi></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W_{charge} = \\max\\left(W, \\frac{V}{k}\\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ha</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4em;vertical-align:-0.95em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>对轻抛货（如服饰、家居纺织品），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V/k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 通常远大于 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span></span>，此时压体积就是压成本，装载方案必须优先填满空隙；对重货（如小家电），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span></span> 主导，此时反而要在不超限重的前提下留出体积余量。<strong>同一个批次窗口里的轻抛货与重货混装，是提高装载率的经典手法</strong>——重货填底、轻货填缝，让整柜的计费重接近最优。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE return_batch_container (&#10;  container_id      VARCHAR(24) PRIMARY KEY,   -- 集装单元标识（SSCC 或其子单元）&#10;  batch_id          BIGINT NOT NULL REFERENCES return_consolidation_batch(batch_id),&#10;  unit_type         VARCHAR(16) NOT NULL,      -- PALLET/CARTON/CAGE&#10;  gross_kg          NUMERIC(10,3) NOT NULL,&#10;  volume_cbm        NUMERIC(10,4) NOT NULL,&#10;  volumetric_kg     NUMERIC(10,3) NOT NULL,&#10;  chargeable_kg     NUMERIC(10,3) GENERATED ALWAYS AS (GREATEST(gross_kg, volumetric_kg)) STORED,&#10;  dg_class          VARCHAR(8),                -- 该单元的危险品等级&#10;  seal_no           VARCHAR(32)&#10;);&#10;&#10;CREATE INDEX idx_container_batch ON return_batch_container(batch_id);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> return_batch_container</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  container_id      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">24</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,   </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 集装单元标识（SSCC 或其子单元）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  batch_id          </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> REFERENCES</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> return_consolidation_batch(batch_id),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  unit_type         </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">16</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,      </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- PALLET/CARTON/CAGE</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  gross_kg          </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NUMERIC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  volume_cbm        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NUMERIC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  volumetric_kg     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NUMERIC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  chargeable_kg     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NUMERIC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">GENERATED</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ALWAYS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">GREATEST</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(gross_kg, volumetric_kg)) STORED,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  dg_class          </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">8</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),                </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 该单元的危险品等级</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  seal_no           </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">32</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> INDEX</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> idx_container_batch</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> return_batch_container(batch_id);</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>chargeable_kg</code> 用生成列计算，而不是在应用层算——这样计费重就只有一个定义，报价核对与成本核算不会出现两个数。</p>\n<h2 id=\"封批时的冻结清单\">封批时的冻结清单</h2><p>批次封住的那一刻，它里面的内容必须被冻结成一份不可变的清单，因为这份清单是后续三个独立流程的共同依据：货代的运输合同、2.3 的退运申报、以及到岸后的收货核对。三者对不上会产生最难处理的差异——货代说你装了 300 件、申报写了 300 件、到岸只收到 298 件，缺的两件既可能丢在途，也可能从未装柜。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;batch_id&quot;: 20461,&#10;  &quot;status&quot;: &quot;SEALED&quot;,&#10;  &quot;destination_node_id&quot;: 1187,&#10;  &quot;destination_type&quot;: &quot;REFURB_CENTER_DOMESTIC&quot;,&#10;  &quot;sealed_at&quot;: &quot;2026-09-28T09:14:00Z&quot;,&#10;  &quot;containers&quot;: [&#10;    {&#10;      &quot;container_id&quot;: &quot;SSCC-006976449900001234&quot;,&#10;      &quot;unit_type&quot;: &quot;PALLET&quot;,&#10;      &quot;gross_kg&quot;: 412.6,&#10;      &quot;volume_cbm&quot;: 1.84,&#10;      &quot;volumetric_kg&quot;: 306.7,&#10;      &quot;chargeable_kg&quot;: 412.6,&#10;      &quot;dg_class&quot;: &quot;UN3481&quot;&#10;    }&#10;  ],&#10;  &quot;item_count&quot;: 298,&#10;  &quot;manifest_hash&quot;: &quot;sha256:9f2c...&quot;,&#10;  &quot;customs_doc_status&quot;: &quot;PENDING&quot;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"batch_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">20461</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"status\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"SEALED\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"destination_node_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1187</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"destination_type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"REFURB_CENTER_DOMESTIC\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"sealed_at\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026-09-28T09:14:00Z\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"containers\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"container_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"SSCC-006976449900001234\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"unit_type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"PALLET\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"gross_kg\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">412.6</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"volume_cbm\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1.84</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"volumetric_kg\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">306.7</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"chargeable_kg\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">412.6</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"dg_class\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"UN3481\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"item_count\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">298</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"manifest_hash\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"sha256:9f2c...\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"customs_doc_status\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"PENDING\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>manifest_hash</code> 让到岸核对变成一次哈希比较而不是逐件比对，同时它也是「这批货是不是被中途动过」的证据。<code>customs_doc_status</code> 单独存在，正是上面说的「物流慢 vs 合规慢」分离。</p>\n<h2 id=\"与相邻篇的衔接\">与相邻篇的衔接</h2><p>本篇的输入来自 1.1 的集货节点（候选池与初检等级）和 1.2 的决策函数（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>r</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的批量费率假设）；它的输出——一个封好的批次与一份冻结清单——直接交给 <a href=\"../return-reimport-customs/return-customs-doc-status\">2.3 回运清关单证与状态</a> 去做申报，并最终落到到岸后的 <a href=\"../resale-destroy-link/restockable-return-inventory\">4.1 可再售品回库与库存恢复</a> 的收货核对。批次里货的最终价值判定仍由 <a href=\"../inspect-grade-refurbish/central-inspection-grade\">3.1 集中质检与分级标准</a> 在到岸后产生。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>批次化的目的是让 1.2 决策时假设的批量费率在现实中兑现；单件跨境运输在这个成本区间里不存在。</li>\n<li>拼批窗口是双约束问题：下界由固定成本分摊给出最小批量，上界由折旧与资金占用给出最长等待期，且 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{max}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ma</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 必须按品类设置。</li>\n<li>一个批次只能有一个目的节点（国内翻新中心 vs 保税维修区），因为两者的单证与承运资质不同。</li>\n<li>混拼受三类物理约束支配：危险品兼容性（锂电池尤其）、申报品名与 HS 编码一致性、以及计费重 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>W</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>V</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\max(W, V/k)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 的优化。</li>\n<li>轻抛货与重货混装是提高装载率的经典手法；计费重应作为生成列落在库表里，避免出现两个定义。</li>\n<li>封批即冻结：清单与哈希是货代合同、退运申报、到岸核对三方的共同依据；单证状态必须与物流状态分离，才能归因「合规慢」与「物流慢」。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"退货批量集拼与回运","id":"退货批量集拼与回运"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"拼批窗口：在时效与成本之间取平衡","id":"拼批窗口-在时效与成本之间取平衡"},{"level":3,"text":"按目的节点分流","id":"按目的节点分流"},{"level":2,"text":"混拼的物理约束","id":"混拼的物理约束"},{"level":3,"text":"危险品兼容性","id":"危险品兼容性"},{"level":3,"text":"申报品名与编码一致性","id":"申报品名与编码一致性"},{"level":3,"text":"装载与体积重","id":"装载与体积重"},{"level":2,"text":"封批时的冻结清单","id":"封批时的冻结清单"},{"level":2,"text":"与相邻篇的衔接","id":"与相邻篇的衔接"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"就地处置 vs 回运决策","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/crossborder-returns-inspection-refurb-center/return-consolidate-overseas/dispose-local-vs-return"},"next":{"title":"出口退运与再进口税务","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/crossborder-returns-inspection-refurb-center/return-reimport-customs/export-return-reimport-tax"}}